{"pdfData":[[{"id":"69b627dc-3e16-4cb9-8d11-b546bf8b81b6","type":"text","text":"**关于在Aimer战雷盒子中遇到有关WT自定义常见问题解答**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-0"},{"id":"b8ddba4d-a831-4f00-9579-7bcd237e59e6","type":"text","text":"V1\\.01 bate","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-1"},{"id":"73bbd54b-f1b8-43a1-870d-9e0f7812b847","type":"text","text":"大家好，这里是哈气·发来，由于许多新进想使用战雷盒子的雷批不懂如何去使用此战雷盒子，所以今天我将在这里用书面的形式来为大家讲解。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-2"},{"id":"f70d5a8d-ef17-4514-8773-b59e08850445","type":"text","text":"**1\\.语音包**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-3"},{"id":"2d924183-2c29-4fc3-8a47-f48991af3922","type":"text","text":"**2\\.自定义皮肤**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-4"},{"id":"ef35ce06-5a80-4a2c-981a-ded7c71731a9","type":"text","text":"**3\\.自定义瞄具**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-5"},{"id":"3b5b6c39-9fcd-4c94-9efd-0b9e164ede32","type":"text","text":"**4\\.自定义文字**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-6"},{"id":"2744dddd-0367-4a56-b76d-9c384b4431c8","type":"text","text":"**5\\.安装与启动**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-7"},{"id":"efe31cd3-07e7-46a2-af40-f7a4e3c2be78","type":"text","text":"**6\\.车库问题**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-8"},{"id":"4829242a-5c75-4d36-bad2-9addadee7597","type":"text","text":"1. **关于使用最多的模块，战雷自定义语音包。**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-9"},{"id":"89faca02-9a84-4752-aba4-7a5f5bf5b555","type":"text","text":"    1. **无法加载7\\.zip模式**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-10"},{"type":"image","img_path":"91c55f1bb7e8fc06dc965a7f8fae9e24a0489c9162233e650bf28e31564e285b.jpg","page_idx":0,"id":"56255d1a-9e63-46ce-a940-77f7bc8fea28","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-11"},{"id":"766ff190-6bce-42be-b285-4276f312acba","type":"text","text":"答：如此情况，此为老版本的BUG，请移步任意QQ群中的群文件进行下载，或者进入GitHub的此网页进行下载最新款","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-12"},{"id":"a960d241-112d-453b-a4ed-10ee87c50506","type":"text","text":"[GitHub \\- AimerSo/AimerWT at v3\\.0\\.1 · GitHub](https://github.com/AimerSo/AimerWT/tree/v3.0.1)","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-13"},{"type":"image","img_path":"ea8bd800eb69a79f029660236d7409d79887fb5a398289a619565fd21f88906e.png","page_idx":0,"id":"2476bdae-b432-433d-9040-266074fd1183","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-14"},{"id":"76e6e174-622a-4601-a2b5-4023e6f31b39","type":"text","text":"**1\\.2是否要解压文件才能使用语音包**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-15"},{"id":"67f9fe2f-45ef-4588-a1bb-398eb9714f62","type":"text","text":"答：不需要，因为管理器内有自动帮助玩家进行解压的插件，只需要你将你想要的压缩文件拖动到管理器的语音包管理处即可，","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-16"},{"type":"image","img_path":"21fad3f81daa5756c1dc7ebbe00236c9324c46908c2385d31d586ca258f556a8.png","page_idx":0,"id":"de6fb1a7-c83a-4ded-aef3-d351980a04a8","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-17"},{"id":"83acc49f-232b-4064-87c9-9050242f8b66","type":"text","text":"**1\\.3为什么我将我的下载的语音包下载好了，没有在管理器上加载出来**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-18"},{"type":"image","img_path":"f5d98822e18c5439d9c4c7a5c012e07f21c8c928d2422730764c7219ecaec5a3.png","page_idx":0,"id":"158e6073-a804-434d-a274-98aa3a2f75a5","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-19"},{"id":"c44c5670-aa18-4975-b1f7-e99cd769b4a4","type":"text","text":"答：由于管理器没有强制刷新，且强制刷新可能影响你们的游戏体验（许多玩家在玩游戏的时候不会将这个管理器关闭），需要你们手动点击刷新键来进行刷新，点击我红标处。（1\\.01补丁，3\\.01版本已经修好，但防止老板本，此处保留）","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-20"},{"id":"8e3edae2-8425-469d-aa50-28e499f91ebd","type":"text","text":"**1\\.4为什么文件夹中有某种的语音包，而软件识别中没有。**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-21"},{"id":"c8e10145-b875-4ccd-99dc-9ad31fed8069","type":"text","text":"答：此问题为语音包作者问题，本管理器在安装语音包的     时候就已经识别出语音包中所能用的语音文件，如果发现不能用的管理器就不会给你进行安装。如还有疑问，请咨询此语音包作者。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-22"},{"id":"2b878412-9eeb-4f47-8260-74a81c5e58c3","type":"text","text":"**1\\.5是否还需要我们去手动更改游戏的SOUND的记事本代码。**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-23"},{"id":"1108737b-1ed5-4546-a789-1e6d82e73b85","type":"text","text":"答：不需要，管理器发明的初衷就是为了帮助大家更好的去使用战雷的自定义，这个功能早在V2\\.bate时期就已经完成自动化更改，无需自己手动继续更改。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-24"},{"id":"167ebf8a-9c97-4bb6-bb83-e6a46b0706ed","type":"text","text":"**1\\.6（老问题，防止没解决）为什么我装语音包之后我的游戏一卡一卡的**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-25"},{"id":"7de5f1f1-bb0d-4d3d-8631-24c2e44c0072","type":"text","text":"答:由于BVVD这个老牧师的不发新的语音包文件，加上战雷本身就是史山代码，导致游戏中的自定义语音包出现卡死，可以到我们的QQ群的文件夹中找到降噪包进行替换。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-26"},{"type":"image","img_path":"efa76036303111d695725e29de7f69a45a16123af4a2b5914624920c45f521cf.png","page_idx":0,"id":"451e40ca-5fda-40cf-a8d1-e9217c7b7a85","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-27"},{"id":"a3f60cbc-1fe2-4e6e-9e0b-8b3fcab08eb0","type":"text","text":"**1\\.7为啥我安装语音包的时候会一直弹游戏路径有问题**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-28"},{"id":"7eab5bc3-f082-414e-8d58-8241840c3624","type":"text","text":"答：因为我们的管理器忘记做自动补sound块了，导致我们的管理器无法识别到语音包已经成功拖入。所以，请下载群里已打补丁的版本821版。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-29"},{"id":"da986a43-f2df-4cf7-a9b6-a3e08092498b","type":"text","text":"**1\\.8为啥我输入解压密码的时候出现网页跳不出来的问题。**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-30"},{"id":"8dc280f2-15c0-4482-9936-211c85e92c78","type":"text","text":"答：这属于一个BUG，开发者说已经修好，但存疑。如果出现无法跳转的界面，请大退管理器，然后在管理器外侧将文件解压完毕。之后再拖进文件夹中","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-31"},{"id":"8cb63469-8ae3-4f77-8283-ddab2f6a2824","type":"text","text":"**2\\.自定义皮肤**这个最简单，基本没什么好讲的。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-32"},{"id":"ec882a0f-cd4c-42ec-b874-906e19ecb5db","type":"text","text":"**2\\.1我导入了，为什么游戏里面没有**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-33"},{"id":"a3f4fe6f-c6b5-40f8-a24b-eb4c7cca5abf","type":"text","text":"答：你需要在游戏中的外观定制中找到自定涂装，点进去就能找到你导入的皮肤","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-34"},{"id":"62acfa4f-8865-4d3b-a212-9c91ddd190ee","type":"text","text":"**2\\.2为啥我无法导入**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-35"},{"id":"bb3e94c3-0ddd-477b-a327-2c1ec773854f","type":"text","text":"答：开发者说已经成功完成自动建库，此为真。但是考虑到有许多人用的是旧版本，导致无法自动建库，所以需要老版本的用户到游戏的自定义外观中进行手动建库，就在自定义涂装旁边有一根仙女棒，点一下就自己建库了。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-36"},{"id":"936e7d84-3943-46c5-b3f6-1418e6bce589","type":"text","text":"**3\\.自定义瞄具**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-37"},{"id":"286d26b3-5247-4791-a04d-09b94d7d3a05","type":"text","text":"**3\\.1为什么我在游戏里面搜索设置，没有选项**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-38"},{"id":"21efb30f-88e1-46ec-9b2a-f9ebc168a09b","type":"text","text":"答：这个东西无法在更改按键的地方进行更改，这个东西只在游戏选项中进行更改。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-39"},{"id":"a0feb803-eba4-450e-a060-1efda8b953ce","type":"text","text":"**3\\.2为什么我在更改界面没有瞄具选项**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-40"},{"id":"c3f363a3-616e-46e9-9a50-eeaf134372b5","type":"text","text":"答：因为要在这里进行选择","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-41"},{"type":"image","img_path":"5437f174f280fbd70609851fc584a86ab0b0750550b611909914250424ea908d.png","page_idx":0,"id":"51c8c165-a265-4b2b-9f2e-3084e2c21dd1","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-42"},{"id":"b18ebbec-ed26-4cd2-80b4-678435fe9ef2","type":"text","text":"然后再这里进行选择","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-43"},{"type":"image","img_path":"7b3b7dcbc3642485ecc924efd873f54a312c6fd76ff2a55a2b45d6d76f0b3f49.png","page_idx":0,"id":"fc6baca5-d008-4f7d-a9bb-7b7ae0520de3","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-44"},{"id":"00dc39ae-d644-43d1-9b76-0c3b8e1e9ab5","type":"text","text":"**3\\.3为啥我都加入了，为啥我找不到自定义炮镜呢**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-45"},{"id":"2e1742be-368c-4b00-b28a-3e5763b2ea36","type":"text","text":"答：请检查你自己的UID是否是你现在所使用的账号的","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-46"},{"id":"26480ede-b035-4a6b-8354-477e5a25fa26","type":"text","text":"3\\.3补充，如何了解你现在玩的UID是哪个，先进入游戏，然后退 出，之后进入进入此电脑，根据我图片上面的导引一步一步的找到这个文件夹里面。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-47"},{"type":"image","img_path":"acd17cf0dc6d147c8e2557b6a5fb3e173aa4fadfab2f5605bc5c6d348d7a19cc.png","page_idx":0,"id":"d81c9b47-2e1f-4e83-82fe-deac75f51940","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-48"},{"id":"50eab838-5115-4546-bd32-3a3c88d0fcc4","type":"text","text":"然后点击这里，这里面的UID就是你现在在玩的UID。之后就到管理器的这里进行查找","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-49"},{"type":"image","img_path":"99c4ede5dcd147d074d2367b69371e9dc3828b9c561b69398db055b672a11ed8.png","page_idx":0,"id":"3bad27f9-fca6-4f46-a953-4a1297054c6e","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-50"},{"type":"image","img_path":"b267e16fa32ec573499a0bda09c59877df15fe28de279d2afd8c756e4de7c2e1.png","page_idx":0,"id":"8deb77d4-78cc-4e3b-9cf5-c16bb240bcfb","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-51"},{"id":"927c7ce4-a75d-4daf-a276-d4c73b7cf08a","type":"text","text":"**3\\.4为啥我的炮镜导入不了**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-52"},{"id":"cc9ee1e3-5db4-4f0f-95bf-0009d3e193cc","type":"text","text":"答：可能是你没有在文件夹中创建一个文件夹，名为 all\\_tanks 因为只有这个才能被战雷的客户端识别为你的炮镜资料。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-53"},{"id":"7a2227a7-6516-4308-9de3-0fc834e370de","type":"text","text":"**3\\.5 为啥我导入炮镜的时候会出现这种问题**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-54"},{"id":"6a8085cc-dfa5-4c73-a0b7-cc9cd2ae5c7b","type":"text","text":"（由QQ用户@这个滨滨就是逊了 发现）","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-55"},{"id":"4390850c-b6d3-4b6a-80b3-6348b7a23c1c","type":"text","text":"1. 答：因为这属于管理器的一个小BUG，现在已经修复，请下载群文件中的821版本。开发者Aimer已经发布补丁版本，现已可以正常使用","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-56"},{"type":"image","img_path":"04a41bee4a6d433603a004371765b27eed548f78e1d169e8c443fcf05c2ac758.jpg","page_idx":0,"id":"90fa2dd4-c9e4-4181-993b-57c50fcf804c","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-57"},{"id":"77b4f258-562d-4084-a96a-94c27157d776","type":"text","text":"**3\\.6为啥我用大松松的炮镜资料会显示导入失败**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-58"},{"id":"a01a28fe-9225-4402-90d4-16ee54d901d3","type":"text","text":"（由@lucifer发现）","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-59"},{"type":"image","img_path":"04a41bee4a6d433603a004371765b27eed548f78e1d169e8c443fcf05c2ac758.jpg","page_idx":0,"id":"f884638a-8a27-48af-be93-1d7f102dfb12","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-60"},{"id":"716013e8-b728-4956-833f-edd1a154b76d","type":"text","text":"答：因为大松松的炮镜中有很多的重名文件，使得管理器为了保证用户体验而采取的保护措施，其保护措施如下，一无法让管理自行更改瞄准镜名字，如有需要，请自行更改。（当然这其实也是一个BUG，现在也正在修复）","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-61"},{"id":"8bcf23a0-b651-4599-8843-7790bb5a5e33","type":"text","text":"**4\\.自定义文字**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-62"},{"id":"c743a4f2-6b1e-43b6-9d1c-054fef48a939","type":"text","text":"这个其实没有什么要讲的，将大家最想改的地方标出来","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-63"},{"id":"3d760c2b-a703-4652-990c-489a25f71b00","type":"text","text":"Exp\\_reasons 这个是改局内命中，包括命中，致命伤害，重创目标等，如果有需要更改，请自行探索，我方不在做其他解释。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-64"},{"id":"ac2a58ac-7051-40c7-9f52-773025ebdbeb","type":"text","text":"**5\\.安装与启动**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-65"},{"id":"e8847436-6fe1-49d0-9543-c54fefaeebf7","type":"text","text":"**5\\.1我是电脑小白，我不知道怎么下载有关的管理器**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-66"},{"id":"cf0a3739-7a1f-4e6b-b18c-2ca6defca82f","type":"text","text":"答：需要考虑你电脑的系统，大部分人的系统WINDOWS，所以只需要下载群文件中的文件即可，这可以大大的节约你们的时间，当然如果是linux系统的话，建议你直接去GitHub上找到Aimerso的主页，下载最新的AimerWT最新管理器。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-67"},{"id":"8e77ba11-b67c-489e-afbb-ae4e34a6a66a","type":"text","text":"**5\\.2为啥我下载了正确的版本，我用不来了**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-68"},{"id":"605e22d5-7ab5-4571-9b4f-abd7c142b9f4","type":"text","text":"答：有可能是因为你的电脑的系统过老，如Win7或Win8，这些系统不支持PY10，而我们的这个管理器的基础就是搭在PY10上的，同时我们不可能费劲去向下兼容，一是没有必要，二是现在的软件已经逐步淘汰掉WIN7系统，后面战雷也可能淘汰WIN7系统，所以如果遇到安装失败的弹窗，请升级你的系统","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-69"},{"type":"image","img_path":"afac5c7c8894d19ed7bb067c9a6d7f2a100d510e027fa05d2ebaad9a5ffaec39.png","page_idx":0,"id":"25fc4897-d068-472c-bde0-1c7a6cc46c32","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-70"},{"id":"9fbd7494-2886-423d-aa5b-5bc25d91d229","type":"text","text":"**5\\.3我已经检查完我的系统了但是为啥弹出这个东西**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-71"},{"id":"ed7b19ea-8146-4218-bd8a-54ae508e13da","type":"text","text":"答：因为你的C盘空间不足，需要你将C盘中的资料迁移到其他盘，不然我们的缓存存不下来，如果想保险起见，请为你的C盘至少留出5G的空间来确保你能够直接打开","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-72"},{"id":"d4ce4e7d-c2b6-495c-9ae8-70dda62ad47b","type":"text","text":"**5\\.4为啥我得不到我的UID。**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-73"},{"id":"78754540-b276-498f-94f2-3c2f7d64d5cd","type":"text","text":"答：因为我们的服务器短时间之内接收到大量的请求，导致服务器压力过大。使得部分使用者出现无法进入的问题。这个我们表示歉意，如果想查到UID请大退管理器，强制让管理器刷新，这样应该就可以连接进入。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-74"},{"type":"image","img_path":"e688ab6749a9f445270d0e185d56b07133ec9090b734d4f7adf966751497e0a0.jpg","page_idx":0,"id":"6cf4af56-f7f7-4bc7-be56-2b4a1fc6e119","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-75"},{"id":"047f036c-009c-4c1c-af42-b4d9b300795f","type":"text","text":"**5\\.5为啥我打开我的管理器会跳出白屏**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-76"},{"id":"aef9aef3-70f3-4087-a973-b6221ddce5e0","type":"text","text":"（由QQ用户@酷爱 和@GTD1250T 先后发现）","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-77"},{"id":"a5ef4cba-744b-4fc3-9b6e-60634920c456","type":"text","text":"答：这属于小插件的消失，现在的解决办法是先用电脑的CMD运行以下指令winget install Microsoft\\.EdgeWebView2Runtime让电脑自动安装插件，再尝试打开管理器；二，如果无法实现，请直接卸载管理器，重新下载，让电脑强兼。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-78"},{"id":"4f902437-882c-45a8-8037-ce2a213618f1","type":"text","text":"**5\\.6为啥我开启了自启动为啥我进去就是白屏了呢**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-79"},{"id":"863f19b2-520e-4750-be19-2da5de87995b","type":"text","text":"（由@AAAPro发现）","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-80"},{"id":"07c69628-dd5a-45cf-80b1-8d35aa3b8482","type":"text","text":"答：这个和上面的那个小插件消失是一样的，因为开机的时候管理器比小插件更早的运行，使得管理器白屏，现在并没有完全根治的办法，要么就是关闭自启动，要么就是自启动之后手动退出管理器重新进入。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-81"},{"id":"3f4fcbe0-99dc-4754-81aa-62d4db80c14d","type":"text","text":"**6\\.车库问题**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-82"},{"id":"a7bedbc3-9b29-45bf-a5bc-cb8d364a997a","type":"text","text":"**6\\.1为什么打不开,**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-83"},{"id":"fe003a71-f89b-47d7-97f3-6c0b9318efaf","type":"text","text":"答:因为某些原因,使得我们的车库资源库暂时无法正常使用,所以需要使用者上网找到对应的教程来进行替换\\.","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-84"},{"id":"14958127-ba2b-4a7f-826a-ae24b449bab0","type":"text","text":"任务库，车库，以及模型修改现阶段还没有问题，资料缺失。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-85"},{"id":"94374376-6f7f-4690-8249-84449f45b3a2","type":"text","text":"注意！！！加机库可能导致游戏对Config\\.blk重置，可能导致你之前装的语音包和自定义文字失效，请慎重考虑之后再安装","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-86"}]],"mergeConnections":[]}